    old "I need capable, trustworthy companions to support me when the time comes."
    new "我需要可靠、值得信赖的伙伴在关键时刻支持我。."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_fin.rpy:29
    old "You needed help, so I gave it."
    new "你需要帮助，所以我提供了帮助。 "

